## Rupiksha Frontend Environment Configuration Template
## Copy this file to .env for local development

## Local Development Backend URLs
VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api/v1
VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8080

## Staging & Production environments should be configured via .env.staging / .env.production
## or injected directly via Vercel / CI-CD pipeline secrets.
